full_article:
Climate change in the Himalayas is increasing the risks associated with glaciers and glacial lakes. Alongside the impacts felt in Nepal, Sikkim, Kashmir, and Pakistan, infrastructure-related risks are also rising. Therefore, the greatest challenge now lies in issuing early warnings before major disasters occur and strengthening coordination among the affected countries.

Keep updated, follow The Business Standard's Google news channel

